[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5344176036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122584#issuecomment-5344176036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122584","id":5344176036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPomnpA","user":{"login":"matorin57","id":5014337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTQzMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5014337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57","html_url":"https://github.com/matorin57","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T15:18:11Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T15:23:24Z","body":"For anyone else also looking at this. I was poking around and it seems that in `ScriptTextEditor::_show_symbol_tooltip` it is failing to look up the enum symbol as `script->get_language()->get_editor_language()->lookup_code(code_text, p_symbol, script->get_path(), base, result)` returns `ERR_CANT_RESOLVE`.\n\nInside I'm `GDScriptEditorLanguage::lookup_code` I'm seeing the completion context is basically empty which is quite different from when I hover over the enum name itself so I'm guessing it's something within `GDScriptParser::parse`. However not totally sure why it's so different since the parser doesn't even take in the specific symbol and the code passed in on both cases seem the same.\n\nEdit: Discovered there is a slight difference in the code being parsed as where the cursor is when hovering is encoded in the string.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5344176036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5349394819","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122584#issuecomment-5349394819","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122584","id":5349394819,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPtlJgw","user":{"login":"matorin57","id":5014337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTQzMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5014337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57","html_url":"https://github.com/matorin57","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T23:49:25Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T23:49:25Z","body":"I found the place where i can call `make_completion_context` within `parse_enum` that will align with the cursor positions. Now trying to see how to correctly wire it up so the look up actually succeeds at getting the enum value.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5349394819/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5349595592","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122584#issuecomment-5349595592","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122584","id":5349595592,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPtxZyA","user":{"login":"matorin57","id":5014337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTQzMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5014337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57","html_url":"https://github.com/matorin57","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T00:17:54Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T00:17:54Z","body":"Ok so I was able to hack together this inside `parse_enum` and the tool tip does appear on both the anonymous enum and the named enum item declarations.\n\n<img width=\"1232\" height=\"632\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb1e3a4d-d710-4df4-8041-bd5bd30415f7\" />\n\nIt seems to be that when you need to create the completion context inside the enum declaration there isn't really a way to mark it as a \"enum constant\", which is an issue since if you mark it is an identifier it will fail to find it in `_lookup_in_base_class` since the the name of the identifier is nested inside the enum and so the class thinks it doesn't have a member of the symbols name. However if I fake it as a subscript then it will start looking inside the enum declaration with the same identifier.\n\nFor the anonymous enum, just needed to add the completion call since anonymous enums are looked up by identifier anyway.\n\nI'm gonna see if I can make a better way of doing this with a new completion type of \"ENUM_DECLARATION\" or something so I'm not making a faking subscript node and attaching it. \n\nI am also noticing a separate issue with the doc strings, I might just be doing them wrong but it seems like doc strings on enum values don't show up, even in the places where the tool tip was already working.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5349595592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5349939987","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122584#issuecomment-5349939987","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122584","id":5349939987,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPuGbEw","user":{"login":"matorin57","id":5014337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTQzMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5014337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57","html_url":"https://github.com/matorin57","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T01:10:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T01:10:24Z","body":"Have a draft PR with the main changes adding the tool tip. Still looking into the doc strings issue which appears to be from before the changes in the PR. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122621\n\nNo need for a full review yet, just wanted to give anyone else a chance to see the current fix if they want.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5349939987/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5350210843","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122584#issuecomment-5350210843","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122584","id":5350210843,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPuW9Gw","user":{"login":"matorin57","id":5014337,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMTQzMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5014337?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57","html_url":"https://github.com/matorin57","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matorin57/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T01:50:24Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T01:50:24Z","body":"Ok so I found the issue for the doc strings issue.\nIn `EditorHelpBit::_get_constant_help_data` the call to `EditorHelp::get_doc(p_class_name)` fails because the class name passed in is \"\\\"main.gd\\\".Named\" instead of \"\\\"main.gd\\\"\". Trying to see if there a reasonable way to trim off that \".Named\" without making unnecessary assumptions on what the class name should look like.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5350210843/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]